{
  "$comment": "Mobile library (React Native Reusables) theme source, Spec 117 §7 dated note 2026-11-10 (MF-35; X6) and §6.1 (the S-002 shades); Spec 126 §11b.4. Each RNR colour role names ONE source token, so every hex keeps one definition site: a quoted colour key of mobile/tailwind.config.js ({file, key}) or a member of an exported object of mobile/src/constants/parcelSearch.ts ({file, object, key}; a class-string member yields its one -[#rrggbb] value). The role list is the plan v2 section 5 table: --destructive-foreground has no value and no consumer, so it is left out (plan v3 section 5). The same values go under :root and .dark:root (P35-D2 a). Contrast minimums are WCAG 2.1 AA (text 4.5, non_text 3), as web-theme.json. Generator: scripts/surfaces/emit-mobile-theme.mjs (--write after any edit here or to a source token).",
  "roles": {
    "--background": { "file": "mobile/src/constants/parcelSearch.ts", "object": "PARCEL_SEARCH_TOKENS", "key": "screenBg" },
    "--foreground": { "file": "mobile/tailwind.config.js", "key": "text-primary" },
    "--card-foreground": { "file": "mobile/tailwind.config.js", "key": "text-primary" },
